From: Neogram Patchset <patches@neogram.invalid>
Subject: debloat/volume-buttons-video: volume buttons only change the volume in chats

Behind NeoOptions.VOLUME_BUTTONS_PLAY_VIDEOS (on by default, as in stock). With it off, LaunchActivity no longer turns a volume key press in a chat into playing the visible video with sound (ChatActivity.maybePlayVisibleVideo); the key only changes the volume.
